WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
A stranger asks for directions. A door passes between you, and when it clears, somebody else is there.

2
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
In a 1998 experiment, only half the pedestrians noticed the switch under the tested conditions.

3
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:20.000
That does not mean memory always fails. It means attention follows a task,

4
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:27.000
and important changes can sometimes escape detection. Before believing an extraordinary claim,

5
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:34.000
ask what was recorded and what was merely assumed. Read the original study,

6
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:42.000
try a no-cost observation ledger, and question any product that promises to rewire attention.
